(6160921, 909065, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours right throughout the spectrum.  I like the movement in the clouds the extended exposure has captured.  The dark silhouette of the hills blocking most of the city lights ensures this can only be a skyscape image.</td>', 'Lovely colours right throughout the spectrum.  I like the movement in the clouds the extended exposure has captured.  The dark silhouette of the hills blocking most of the city lights ensures this can only be a skyscape image.', '2010-09-13 17:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6160925, 909309, 40391, '<td valign="top">I like the angled feature bringing added interest to the shot.  The moody clouds against the darkened blue sky works well.  On my screen in the top right of the image is a strange circle of aqua and yellow.  I''m not sure if it''s a result of sort of lense flare or PP but it does distract from the shot.  There also appears to be a sensor dust spot in the main cloud on the right that may have been worth cloning out. Overall, a nice skyscape shot.</td>', 'I like the angled feature bringing added interest to the shot.  The moody clouds against the darkened blue sky works well.  On my screen in the top right of the image is a strange circle of aqua and yellow.  I''m not sure if it''s a result of sort of lense flare or PP but it does distract from the shot.  There also appears to be a sensor dust spot in the main cloud on the right that may have been worth cloning out. Overall, a nice skyscape shot.', '2010-09-13 17:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6160928, 908710, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2010-09-13 17:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6160931, 909081, 67258, '<td valign="top">You lucky, lucky person!  A lovely photo, very well presented.</td>', 'You lucky, lucky person!  A lovely photo, very well presented.', '2010-09-13 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6160932, 908845, 40391, '<td valign="top">Some very nice colours are captured with this image.  I really like the strong silhouette as well.  The blown highlights close to the sun were probably unavoidable but still a little painful to view.  To fully meet the challange IMO the shot (and title) would be better off without the person as he appears as the main subject.  However, as a general composition it works well.</td>', 'Some very nice colours are captured with this image.  I really like the strong silhouette as well.  The blown highlights close to the sun were probably unavoidable but still a little painful to view.  To fully meet the challange IMO the shot (and title) would be better off without the person as he appears as the main subject.  However, as a general composition it works well.', '2010-09-13 17:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6160945, 908545, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great one. Nice natural look, not over-processed. Great colors.</td>', 'Great one. Nice natural look, not over-processed. Great colors.', '2010-09-13 17:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6160976, 908879, 108069, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo. Wonderful colors yet it doesn''t feel overly processed at all. Nice one.</td>', 'Stunning photo. Wonderful colors yet it doesn''t feel overly processed at all. Nice one.', '2010-09-13 17:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
