(6161107, 909081, 40391, '<td valign="top">The colours are lovely and the band of clouds work well with the panoramic feel you''ve created. Well done.</td>', 'The colours are lovely and the band of clouds work well with the panoramic feel you''ve created. Well done.', '2010-09-13 20:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161109, 909058, 57447, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2010-09-13 20:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161110, 909193, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m really loving the colours and motion created with this image.  It almost looks like the flow of a mountain stream full of weeds.  The clump of branches gives away the shot - which is nice.  However, if I was asked to give several catagories to fit this shot, I don''t believe skyscape would come to mind.  In a different challenge I would have scored this much higher - 5.</td>', 'I''m really loving the colours and motion created with this image.  It almost looks like the flow of a mountain stream full of weeds.  The clump of branches gives away the shot - which is nice.  However, if I was asked to give several catagories to fit this shot, I don''t believe skyscape would come to mind.  In a different challenge I would have scored this much higher - 5.', '2010-09-13 21:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161113, 909295, 40391, '<td valign="top">A nice concept that has been pulled off OK.  The inverted landscape in the ball would work better if either darker or of a different location to produce less interest (for me).</td>', 'A nice concept that has been pulled off OK.  The inverted landscape in the ball would work better if either darker or of a different location to produce less interest (for me).', '2010-09-13 21:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161114, 908643, 40391, '<td valign="top">I like the blue achieved from the sky and the water.  Inverting does produce an interesting perspective but I''m not sure it is really working for me.  But an extra point for trying something different that made me stay for a longer look.</td>', 'I like the blue achieved from the sky and the water.  Inverting does produce an interesting perspective but I''m not sure it is really working for me.  But an extra point for trying something different that made me stay for a longer look.', '2010-09-13 21:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161119, 909070, 40391, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic effect you''ve achieved from the clouds.  The silhouette provides added interest without taking away from the challenge theme.  It may not have been possible to achieve but I feel the composition would have been improved if the chimneys were further to the right hand corner (for me anyway)</td>', 'I like the dramatic effect you''ve achieved from the clouds.  The silhouette provides added interest without taking away from the challenge theme.  It may not have been possible to achieve but I feel the composition would have been improved if the chimneys were further to the right hand corner (for me anyway)', '2010-09-13 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161125, 909220, 40391, '<td valign="top">The range of blue you''ve captured in the sky is amazing!  The details and contrast of the balloons are great too.  For any other reason this is a perfect shot, however, I would have loved to have had only a single balloon to add interest to the shot of the sky for this particular challenge as I feel the skyscape theme is reduced..  But the photo wouldn''t have been as good overall.</td>', 'The range of blue you''ve captured in the sky is amazing!  The details and contrast of the balloons are great too.  For any other reason this is a perfect shot, however, I would have loved to have had only a single balloon to add interest to the shot of the sky for this particular challenge as I feel the skyscape theme is reduced..  But the photo wouldn''t have been as good overall.', '2010-09-13 21:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161160, 909160, 29906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. One of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot. One of the best in this challenge.', '2010-09-13 21:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161164, 908430, 29906, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2010-09-13 21:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161166, 909131, 83313, '<td valign="top">This scene is not about the sky, I''m afraid.</td>', 'This scene is not about the sky, I''m afraid.', '2010-09-13 21:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161198, 909158, 65234, '<td valign="top">Heh; I think I was humming that song for much of last week.  Glad someone used the phrase for a title ;-)</td>', 'Heh; I think I was humming that song for much of last week.  Glad someone used the phrase for a title ;-)', '2010-09-13 22:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161204, 908729, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflections.</td>', 'Excellent reflections.', '2010-09-13 22:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161206, 909131, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette and great sky colors.</td>', 'Very nice silhouette and great sky colors.', '2010-09-13 22:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161208, 908615, 65234, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an old abandoned prison I visit sometimes, but "mine" has no city skyline in the background.<br/> <br/>For this challenge, though, I think the image would be much stronger with almost all the foreground cropped out.  Just that bit of city skyline and lots of sky.  Might need to get a slightly different angle for the foreground to drop out but then it looks sort of Oz-like to me.</td>', 'Reminds me of an old abandoned prison I visit sometimes, but "mine" has no city skyline in the background. For this challenge, though, I think the image would be much stronger with almost all the foreground cropped out.  Just that bit of city skyline and lots of sky.  Might need to get a slightly different angle for the foreground to drop out but then it looks sort of Oz-like to me.', '2010-09-13 22:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161211, 909282, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice title. Fits the image well.</td>', 'Very nice title. Fits the image well.', '2010-09-13 22:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161216, 909294, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.</td>', 'Great contrast.', '2010-09-13 22:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161218, 908684, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully moody and dark.</td>', 'Wonderfully moody and dark.', '2010-09-13 22:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161221, 909087, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great motion in the clouds and love how the bird emphasizes the vast expanse of sky.</td>', 'Great motion in the clouds and love how the bird emphasizes the vast expanse of sky.', '2010-09-13 22:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161223, 909160, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light in the clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful light in the clouds.', '2010-09-13 22:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
