(6161377, 908618, 65319, '<td valign="top">Oh Jason...I''m happy to see this one do well for you.  Such a compelling and deeply emotive sky.  (Hmmmm...and I suspect those cheerleaders are hiding behind those reeds!  Cheerful entertainment should never be far from a stormy heart!)  Good Luck to you!  (No vote...just lurking).</td>', 'Oh Jason...I''m happy to see this one do well for you.  Such a compelling and deeply emotive sky.  (Hmmmm...and I suspect those cheerleaders are hiding behind those reeds!  Cheerful entertainment should never be far from a stormy heart!)  Good Luck to you!  (No vote...just lurking).', '2010-09-14 02:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161392, 908870, 40391, '<td valign="top">It peeve''s me off when other''s get the good opportunities!!  But at least you''ve taken the great shot and had the skill to post process this to enhance the photo.  It would be even better if you removed those intrusive dust bunnies (intrusive at least on my monior).  Well done.</td>', 'It peeve''s me off when other''s get the good opportunities!!  But at least you''ve taken the great shot and had the skill to post process this to enhance the photo.  It would be even better if you removed those intrusive dust bunnies (intrusive at least on my monior).  Well done.', '2010-09-14 03:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161395, 908335, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great capture!! Now, what was this challenge again...? Oh - who cares.  Great capture!!</td>', 'Great capture!! Now, what was this challenge again...? Oh - who cares.  Great capture!!', '2010-09-14 03:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161401, 909228, 40391, '<td valign="top">You have rated 133 of 136 images (98%)<br/> <br/>That''s where I''m up to when your shot appears.  I predict a ribbon for this great photo!!  I''m curious, for such a long exposure the water doesn''t appear very smooth.  I hope you explain how this shot was achieved.  Very well done! 9.</td>', 'You have rated 133 of 136 images (98%) That''s where I''m up to when your shot appears.  I predict a ribbon for this great photo!!  I''m curious, for such a long exposure the water doesn''t appear very smooth.  I hope you explain how this shot was achieved.  Very well done! 9.', '2010-09-14 03:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161408, 908710, 30364, '<td valign="top">Really quite beautiful.</td>', 'Really quite beautiful.', '2010-09-14 04:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161410, 908618, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, meticulous photograph.  It''s not (quite) my top pick, but it''s the best photograph by far in terms of craftsmanship, and I reckon it will win you the blue ribbon.  You might not be fortified by that: I''ve never successfully picked a blue ribbon winner in my six years here.</td>', 'Beautiful, meticulous photograph.  It''s not (quite) my top pick, but it''s the best photograph by far in terms of craftsmanship, and I reckon it will win you the blue ribbon.  You might not be fortified by that: I''ve never successfully picked a blue ribbon winner in my six years here.', '2010-09-14 04:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161493, 908219, 101702, '<td valign="top">One of 3 ten''s I gave out in this challenge, and therefore my pick for a ribbon (usually known as my "Kiss of Death") Great image, and of the 3, it''s my pick for the Blue.</td>', 'One of 3 ten''s I gave out in this challenge, and therefore my pick for a ribbon (usually known as my "Kiss of Death") Great image, and of the 3, it''s my pick for the Blue.', '2010-09-14 08:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161494, 908854, 101702, '<td valign="top">One of 3 ten''s I gave out in this challenge, and therefore my pick for a ribbon (usually known as my "Kiss of Death") Great image.</td>', 'One of 3 ten''s I gave out in this challenge, and therefore my pick for a ribbon (usually known as my "Kiss of Death") Great image.', '2010-09-14 08:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161495, 908684, 101702, '<td valign="top">One of 3 ten''s I gave out in this challenge, and therefore my pick for a ribbon (usually known as my "Kiss of Death") Great image.</td>', 'One of 3 ten''s I gave out in this challenge, and therefore my pick for a ribbon (usually known as my "Kiss of Death") Great image.', '2010-09-14 08:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161496, 909081, 101702, '<td valign="top">Very jealous of where you live! I actually find the white bands on the border a little distracting... maybe if they were a lot narrower it would be better, or maybe colour matched with the sky? Great shot though.</td>', 'Very jealous of where you live! I actually find the white bands on the border a little distracting... maybe if they were a lot narrower it would be better, or maybe colour matched with the sky? Great shot though.', '2010-09-14 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161497, 909257, 101702, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit less land a more sky would meet the challenge better I feel. I appreciate you''ve gone for the rule of thirds, but I''d be looking for the rule of 9ths maybe :-) That said, I don''t feel that it is DNMC so won''t be docking any marks.</td>', 'A tiny bit less land a more sky would meet the challenge better I feel. I appreciate you''ve gone for the rule of thirds, but I''d be looking for the rule of 9ths maybe :-) That said, I don''t feel that it is DNMC so won''t be docking any marks.', '2010-09-14 08:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161499, 909183, 101702, '<td valign="top">Is this the tiniest bit off level? Or are my eyes wonky?</td>', 'Is this the tiniest bit off level? Or are my eyes wonky?', '2010-09-14 08:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161500, 909222, 101702, '<td valign="top">Very slightly wonky? Nice shot though</td>', 'Very slightly wonky? Nice shot though', '2010-09-14 08:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161502, 908730, 101702, '<td valign="top">Seems very slighty tilted to one side. I would have cropped a litte bit more off the bottom losing the reflections of the green / orange lights from the bottom. Nice vibrant shot though.</td>', 'Seems very slighty tilted to one side. I would have cropped a litte bit more off the bottom losing the reflections of the green / orange lights from the bottom. Nice vibrant shot though.', '2010-09-14 08:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161503, 909280, 101702, '<td valign="top">I feel the pier is more of a subject than the sky, albeit this composition feels natural. The pier lower down might not feel right but maybe would be more of a "supporting role" as per the challenge. Here I feel it is a key element.</td>', 'I feel the pier is more of a subject than the sky, albeit this composition feels natural. The pier lower down might not feel right but maybe would be more of a "supporting role" as per the challenge. Here I feel it is a key element.', '2010-09-14 08:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161505, 909237, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m saying the cityscape here is the main subject, with the sky in the supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I think it''s a fantastic image though so I am torn. Nonetheless, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.</td>', 'I''m saying the cityscape here is the main subject, with the sky in the supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I think it''s a fantastic image though so I am torn. Nonetheless, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161506, 909069, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m saying the cityscape here is the main subject, with the sky in the supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I think it''s a fantastic image though so I am torn. Nonetheless, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC. Plus, I think a slightly tighter crop losing the railing on the far left would be tidier. There are a few NYC shots in this challenge, this is one of the nicest.</td>', 'I''m saying the cityscape here is the main subject, with the sky in the supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I think it''s a fantastic image though so I am torn. Nonetheless, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC. Plus, I think a slightly tighter crop losing the railing on the far left would be tidier. There are a few NYC shots in this challenge, this is one of the nicest.', '2010-09-14 08:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161507, 909220, 101702, '<td valign="top">Love the balloons, and a very nicely exposed shot. However, I''m seeing the subject as the balloons and not the sky. Once could argue that they are "in" the sky but I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.</td>', 'Love the balloons, and a very nicely exposed shot. However, I''m seeing the subject as the balloons and not the sky. Once could argue that they are "in" the sky but I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161509, 908125, 101702, '<td valign="top">Really nice abstract but this to me is a picture (however abstract) of some flowers, rather than of the sky. Therefore I will be knocking a mark or two off for my perception of a DNMC. That said, I would glady hang this on my bedroom wall.</td>', 'Really nice abstract but this to me is a picture (however abstract) of some flowers, rather than of the sky. Therefore I will be knocking a mark or two off for my perception of a DNMC. That said, I would glady hang this on my bedroom wall.', '2010-09-14 08:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161510, 909188, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m saying that the subject of your photo is the parachutists, not "the sky" as per the challenge. One could argue that they are "in" the sky, but they are not the sky. My wife actually thinks that this does meet the challenge (and I can''t argue that it''s a great shot - very simple in composition, and great visual impact), but unfortunately for you she''s not voting, I am. Therefore, I will be knocking off a mark or two for my perception of a DNMC. Sorry</td>', 'I''m saying that the subject of your photo is the parachutists, not "the sky" as per the challenge. One could argue that they are "in" the sky, but they are not the sky. My wife actually thinks that this does meet the challenge (and I can''t argue that it''s a great shot - very simple in composition, and great visual impact), but unfortunately for you she''s not voting, I am. Therefore, I will be knocking off a mark or two for my perception of a DNMC. Sorry', '2010-09-14 08:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161511, 908709, 101702, '<td valign="top">A bit too much land I think.. this is slightly more than a supporting role. Love the feel of the shot though.</td>', 'A bit too much land I think.. this is slightly more than a supporting role. Love the feel of the shot though.', '2010-09-14 08:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161512, 908691, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot and cleverly titled. However, I''m seeing the crane and the moon as the main subjects rather than the sky, and not as a "supporting role". Therefore I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.</td>', 'Nicely composed shot and cleverly titled. However, I''m seeing the crane and the moon as the main subjects rather than the sky, and not as a "supporting role". Therefore I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161513, 909187, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m saying the cityscape here is the main subject, with the sky in the supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I think it''s a fantastic image though so I am torn. Nonetheless, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.</td>', 'I''m saying the cityscape here is the main subject, with the sky in the supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I think it''s a fantastic image though so I am torn. Nonetheless, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161516, 909273, 101702, '<td valign="top">Another great photo that I feel DNMC. I''m seeing the building as the subject of this shot, and the sky is in a supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I really like the shot but I am torn. However, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.</td>', 'Another great photo that I feel DNMC. I''m seeing the building as the subject of this shot, and the sky is in a supporting role, the opposite of the challenge brief. I really like the shot but I am torn. However, I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161517, 908335, 101702, '<td valign="top">Can''t help feeling this is a photo of a model rather than a photo of the sky - the sky seems to be the supporting feature in this. In my opinion this would be a much better shot without the model, and would also meet the challenge more. Therefore I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.</td>', 'Can''t help feeling this is a photo of a model rather than a photo of the sky - the sky seems to be the supporting feature in this. In my opinion this would be a much better shot without the model, and would also meet the challenge more. Therefore I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161518, 909193, 101702, '<td valign="top">Great abstract, although I''m seeing more tree than sky.</td>', 'Great abstract, although I''m seeing more tree than sky.', '2010-09-14 08:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161519, 908871, 101702, '<td valign="top">As strange as it sounds I find the person distracting - they become the focal point to me rather than the sky. I would like the minimalst abstract nature of this shot without her in the frame. It is something I could see hanging on the wall of a fancy art gallery then.</td>', 'As strange as it sounds I find the person distracting - they become the focal point to me rather than the sky. I would like the minimalst abstract nature of this shot without her in the frame. It is something I could see hanging on the wall of a fancy art gallery then.', '2010-09-14 08:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161520, 909270, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I''m seeing the structure (ship?) and the balloons as the main subject, with the sky as only a supporting role - the opposite of the challenge brief. Therefore I will be knocking a point off for my perception that it DNMC.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I''m seeing the structure (ship?) and the balloons as the main subject, with the sky as only a supporting role - the opposite of the challenge brief. Therefore I will be knocking a point off for my perception that it DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161522, 908698, 101702, '<td valign="top">Whilst a nice shot, I see the structure as the main subject with the sky as a supporting role, opposite to the challenge brief. I am therfore knocking a point off for my perception that this DNMC.</td>', 'Whilst a nice shot, I see the structure as the main subject with the sky as a supporting role, opposite to the challenge brief. I am therfore knocking a point off for my perception that this DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161523, 908213, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing the paragliders as the subject of this shot, rather than the sky. Once could argue that they are "in" the sky, but without the paragliders the sky is nothing. It''s probably down to interpretation of the challenge brief, but my feeling is that this DNMC. The majority of entrants match my interpretation of the challenge - i.e. moody clouds, maybe burst of sun, perhaps a tiny strip of land as the supporting role. Therefore I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.</td>', 'I''m seeing the paragliders as the subject of this shot, rather than the sky. Once could argue that they are "in" the sky, but without the paragliders the sky is nothing. It''s probably down to interpretation of the challenge brief, but my feeling is that this DNMC. The majority of entrants match my interpretation of the challenge - i.e. moody clouds, maybe burst of sun, perhaps a tiny strip of land as the supporting role. Therefore I''m knocking a point off for my perceived DNMC.', '2010-09-14 08:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161524, 909290, 101702, '<td valign="top">Don''t really get this image.... are the lines telegraph wires?</td>', 'Don''t really get this image.... are the lines telegraph wires?', '2010-09-14 08:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161563, 908870, 14867, '<td valign="top">Could be more luminous, but it''s still a fine capture</td>', 'Could be more luminous, but it''s still a fine capture', '2010-09-14 10:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161572, 909296, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice radiating clouds from the sun. Great colors.</td>', 'Nice radiating clouds from the sun. Great colors.', '2010-09-14 10:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161573, 909087, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well spotted and a nice capture. Excellent perspective of the solitary bird against the brightest patch of cloud. Sharp as well. Nice shot.</td>', 'Well spotted and a nice capture. Excellent perspective of the solitary bird against the brightest patch of cloud. Sharp as well. Nice shot.', '2010-09-14 10:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161575, 909034, 108069, '<td valign="top">Divided indeed. Nice take on it. City is underplayed, which is good. Interesting colors. Cool shot.</td>', 'Divided indeed. Nice take on it. City is underplayed, which is good. Interesting colors. Cool shot.', '2010-09-14 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161577, 909198, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice moody cloud shot. Good definition. Nice range of colors and tones.</td>', 'Nice moody cloud shot. Good definition. Nice range of colors and tones.', '2010-09-14 10:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
