(6163136, 909058, 96751, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why, but this makes me think of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Roz</a>...  Moody and magnificent.  That lone ray poking up really balances the image.</td>', 'Don''t know why, but this makes me think of  Roz...  Moody and magnificent.  That lone ray poking up really balances the image.', '2010-09-15 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163138, 909153, 96751, '<td valign="top">How cool is this! Love the subject matter, and the composition.  But for me the sky borders on too processed, while everything on the ground is just too flatand oversharpened.</td>', 'How cool is this! Love the subject matter, and the composition.  But for me the sky borders on too processed, while everything on the ground is just too flatand oversharpened.', '2010-09-15 16:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
