(6166613, 908565, 98339, '<td valign="top">while others need more noise reduction...this seems to have to much, the clouds are smoothed out to much IMO</td>', 'while others need more noise reduction...this seems to have to much, the clouds are smoothed out to much IMO', '2010-09-20 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
