(6166667, 909228, 25355, '<td valign="top">Just as I predicted - a star trail picture to be the winner. And it''s a fantastic one. Congratulations.</td>', 'Just as I predicted - a star trail picture to be the winner. And it''s a fantastic one. Congratulations.', '2010-09-20 01:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
