(6166710, 908618, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by william88:</b></div><hr/><i> I was there near you when you shot this photo. The ATV place?<br/>But how come I don''t have clouds? <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=909368" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/59267/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_909368.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/59267/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_909368.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/59267/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_909368.jpg"/></a> <br/>Your sky is spectacular!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha! no wonder, we have one day difference. Congratulations on one more star!</td>', 'Originally posted by william88: I was there near you when you shot this photo. The ATV place?But how come I don''t have clouds?  Your sky is spectacular!!   Ha! no wonder, we have one day difference. Congratulations on one more star!', '2010-09-20 01:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
