(6166826, 908710, 67258, '<td valign="top">This was my top vote for the challenge - an absolutely gorgeous photo, and as giant mike says, it has a calming quality.</td>', 'This was my top vote for the challenge - an absolutely gorgeous photo, and as giant mike says, it has a calming quality.', '2010-09-20 03:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6166846, 908430, 113075, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> love the billowy blue clouds...did you take this while in flight?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dear Janine, <br/> <br/>This picture was taken standing with my two feet on the ground, so not in flight. You probably heard about the famous Dutch skies.... <br/> <br/>Cheers Maarten</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: love the billowy blue clouds...did you take this while in flight??   Dear Janine,  This picture was taken standing with my two feet on the ground, so not in flight. You probably heard about the famous Dutch skies....  Cheers Maarten', '2010-09-20 03:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6166855, 909155, 99263, '<td valign="top">The blur was done entirely on purpose when photographing the image. {1/40s at f4.5} It was not achieved during post processing. It was meant to create a feeling of spirituality in a dreamlike way. The bird not a bird but the representation of a spirit set free from it''s earthly bonds. I am afraid most voters did not see it like that at all.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-20 04:28:21.</i></td>', 'The blur was done entirely on purpose when photographing the image. {1/40s at f4.5} It was not achieved during post processing. It was meant to create a feeling of spirituality in a dreamlike way. The bird not a bird but the representation of a spirit set free from it''s earthly bonds. I am afraid most voters did not see it like that at all.', '2010-09-20 04:55:35.000000', '2010-09-20 05:28:21.000000', 0),
(6166857, 909155, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m rather impressed by the voting split.  Although I''m sure you wont agree but it''s a pitty you didn''t get one more 1 vote :-)<br/> <br/>I thought the shot was quite nice and had given it a 6.</td>', 'I''m rather impressed by the voting split.  Although I''m sure you wont agree but it''s a pitty you didn''t get one more 1 vote :-) I thought the shot was quite nice and had given it a 6.', '2010-09-20 05:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6166858, 909155, 99263, '<td valign="top">Yes Abra nice voting split and it shows that the voters were 100% divided.  An extra 1 would have made it perfect indeed.<br/>Ps. Funny...your entry got a 6 from me also.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-20 04:33:16.</i></td>', 'Yes Abra nice voting split and it shows that the voters were 100% divided.  An extra 1 would have made it perfect indeed.Ps. Funny...your entry got a 6 from me also.', '2010-09-20 05:08:32.000000', '2010-09-20 05:33:16.000000', 0),
(6166860, 908449, 99263, '<td valign="top">I also like this and it got a 6 from me.</td>', 'I also like this and it got a 6 from me.', '2010-09-20 05:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6166864, 909188, 20799, '<td valign="top">Well I think it''s an awesome shot and totally meets the challenge (unless you try really hard not to see the sun!), I gave it a 10 and expected to see it much higher, around William''s star trail photo. Beautiful color!</td>', 'Well I think it''s an awesome shot and totally meets the challenge (unless you try really hard not to see the sun!), I gave it a 10 and expected to see it much higher, around William''s star trail photo. Beautiful color!', '2010-09-20 05:23:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6166865, 909155, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wow, I don''t think I have ever seen a voting spread as symmetrical as this!  I am another who really liked the motion blur of the bird.</td>', 'Wow, I don''t think I have ever seen a voting spread as symmetrical as this!  I am another who really liked the motion blur of the bird.', '2010-09-20 05:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
