(6167109, 908486, 98339, '<td valign="top">sorry I was trying to get to your picture for the comments...I got within the last 30 or so...I gave your picture a 6 score and probably if I had gotten to it (found it before roll over it is one that I would have adjusted to 7) your colors are very good, you used the land/tree line well to support the sky, processing is done well (colors), do you have Topaz Adjust (my new discovery!!!) that program would/could have given you a little more definition in the clouds (3D per say) overall your picture is well done IMO much, much better than most (at least yours doesn''t have screaming noise!!) and IMO it should have scored much better...</td>', 'sorry I was trying to get to your picture for the comments...I got within the last 30 or so...I gave your picture a 6 score and probably if I had gotten to it (found it before roll over it is one that I would have adjusted to 7) your colors are very good, you used the land/tree line well to support the sky, processing is done well (colors), do you have Topaz Adjust (my new discovery!!!) that program would/could have given you a little more definition in the clouds (3D per say) overall your picture is well done IMO much, much better than most (at least yours doesn''t have screaming noise!!) and IMO it should have scored much better...', '2010-09-20 10:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6167125, 909237, 86322, '<td valign="top">Great Photo, even though it has part of the cityscape in it I believe that is all about the ray of light and the sky. I think the city is still on a supportive role here. One of my favorites in the whole challenge.</td>', 'Great Photo, even though it has part of the cityscape in it I believe that is all about the ray of light and the sky. I think the city is still on a supportive role here. One of my favorites in the whole challenge.', '2010-09-20 10:56:58.000000', NULL, 0),
