(6170013, 908335, 18799, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thegrandwazoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Gotta love the haters! Any reason to shit on an Image they will which is too bad really that they are unable to overcome bias and that litte box they put art into. Oh well ...<br/> <br/>I love it dude and the fact that the others can''t makes me love it even more!!!! Well done!!!<br/> <br/>-The Wazz </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, too darn bad that all those people had the nads to state opinions of the shot - even stating them in a respectful way.  Yep, they deserve all the bad things you say about them - haters, biased, they are in a little box, enjoying shitting on images, etc., etc...  and all those other baseless assumptions you can think of.  <br/> <br/>Now why again is it that less and less people are leaving comments?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-22 22:25:23.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by thegrandwazoo: Gotta love the haters! Any reason to shit on an Image they will which is too bad really that they are unable to overcome bias and that litte box they put art into. Oh well ... I love it dude and the fact that the others can''t makes me love it even more!!!! Well done!!! -The Wazz   Yep, too darn bad that all those people had the nads to state opinions of the shot - even stating them in a respectful way.  Yep, they deserve all the bad things you say about them - haters, biased, they are in a little box, enjoying shitting on images, etc., etc...  and all those other baseless assumptions you can think of.   Now why again is it that less and less people are leaving comments?', '2010-09-22 23:25:03.000000', '2010-09-22 23:25:23.000000', 0),
(6170544, 908335, 50231, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gatorguy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thegrandwazoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Gotta love the haters! Any reason to shit on an Image they will which is too bad really that they are unable to overcome bias and that litte box they put art into. Oh well ...<br/> <br/>I love it dude and the fact that the others can''t makes me love it even more!!!! Well done!!!<br/> <br/>-The Wazz </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, too darn bad that all those people had the nads to state opinions of the shot - even stating them in a respectful way.  Yep, they deserve all the bad things you say about them - haters, biased, they are in a little box, enjoying shitting on images, etc., etc...  and all those other baseless assumptions you can think of.  <br/> <br/>Now why again is it that less and less people are leaving comments? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey I call it like I see it. Much like all those other comments you reference. Seems to me that makes us both hypocrites, don''t you think? And following your line of reason all opinions are baseless. (See! Another opinion!)<br/> <br/>Regarding your passive aggressive rhetorical question "Now why again is it that less and less people are leaving comments?"  I will answer even though I know you believe it was comments like mine. As been hashed to death in the forums, the replies from the photog to the commenter would be the reason. But hell I''ll be your huckleberry! <br/> <br/>Now, for the sake of Sir Leroy''s image, if you feel the need to continue this inane blast feel free to PM me. <br/> <br/>PEACE!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-25 00:08:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Gatorguy: Originally posted by thegrandwazoo: Gotta love the haters! Any reason to shit on an Image they will which is too bad really that they are unable to overcome bias and that litte box they put art into. Oh well ... I love it dude and the fact that the others can''t makes me love it even more!!!! Well done!!! -The Wazz   Yep, too darn bad that all those people had the nads to state opinions of the shot - even stating them in a respectful way.  Yep, they deserve all the bad things you say about them - haters, biased, they are in a little box, enjoying shitting on images, etc., etc...  and all those other baseless assumptions you can think of.   Now why again is it that less and less people are leaving comments?   Hey I call it like I see it. Much like all those other comments you reference. Seems to me that makes us both hypocrites, don''t you think? And following your line of reason all opinions are baseless. (See! Another opinion!) Regarding your passive aggressive rhetorical question "Now why again is it that less and less people are leaving comments?"  I will answer even though I know you believe it was comments like mine. As been hashed to death in the forums, the replies from the photog to the commenter would be the reason. But hell I''ll be your huckleberry!  Now, for the sake of Sir Leroy''s image, if you feel the need to continue this inane blast feel free to PM me.  PEACE!', '2010-09-23 17:17:46.000000', '2010-09-25 01:08:42.000000', 0),
